# Production build. No domain is written down here: the customer site (e.g. metrofix.<your-domain>)
# and the staff site (admin.metrofix.<your-domain>) both find their API at api.metrofix.<your-domain>
# by themselves. Set these only if your hosting differs.
#
# VITE_API_URL=https://api.example.com        full API address (overrides the automatic one)
# VITE_ADMIN_SUBDOMAIN=admin                  first label that marks the staff site
# VITE_SURFACE=customer                       force one audience (admin | customer | any)
